OL,3,GNEWSAEight arrests after youths cross
OL,4,Arailway line to enter music festival
OL,5,
OL,6,FEight people including a 12-year-old
OL,7,Fboy have been charged in connection
OL,8,Fwith disorder at a weekend dance music
OL,9,Fevent in Edinburgh.
OL,11,FPolice Scotland said youths attempted
OL,12,Fto scale perimeter fencing and
OL,13,Ftrespassed on the railway line
OL,14,Fapproaching Waverley Station to enter
OL,15,Fthe Fly festival in Princes Street
OL,16,FGardens without tickets.
OL,18,FOfficers said they charged males aged
OL,19,F12, 15, 17, three aged 18, a
OL,20,F20-year-old and a 27-year-old with
OL,21,Foffences including assault, breach of
OL,22,Fthe peace and misuse of drugs.
OL,23,APub: 14-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
